# iosfc_registers: Each register read back after a write, 32 bits wide: ring base and size, descriptor base (it maps a page), write counter, the read counter (written only while no ring is mapped), 0x1028 always 1, descriptor enable (bit 0 only; writing it clears the descriptor base). Other offsets, unaligned ones included, read 0xffffffff and ignore writes. A ring size with no base maps nothing and is not stored.
